    "name": "Idle Zombie Wave: Premium",
    "steam_appid": 3609260,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies are invading, and the world is on the brink of collapse! In this apocalyptic survival clash, you will command a team of survivors as a smart and decisive leader. The undead horde is relentless, and only you can lead the survivors in this tower defense (TD) battle to defend your home from wave after wave of the undead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00b7 Massive Zombie Waves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace yourself for an epic survival challenge with endless waves of the undead horde. The number of enemies will exceed your wildest expectations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00b7 Diverse Survivor Roster</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from over 30 unique survivors, each armed with distinct weapons and attack styles. Build the ultimate defense team to clash with the zombie horde.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00b7 Adjutant System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your team's gameplay with different adjutants. Change the tide of battle and overpower the undead with strategic adjutant combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00b7 Roguelike Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover over 200 unique roguelike items to assist in your survival. Adapt your strategy with every bullet and item to withstand the onslaught.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00b7 Epic Boss Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against formidable zombie bosses in thrilling TD clashes. Defend your tower and survive the toughest survival challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Join the battle against the zombie apocalypse! Command your survivors, clash with the undead, and become the ultimate defender in this relentless zombie survival game!</i></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies are invading, and the world is on the brink of collapse! In this apocalyptic survival clash, you will command a team of survivors as a smart and decisive leader. The undead horde is relentless, and only you can lead the survivors in this tower defense (TD) battle to defend your home from wave after wave of the undead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00b7 Massive Zombie Waves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace yourself for an epic survival challenge with endless waves of the undead horde. The number of enemies will exceed your wildest expectations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00b7 Diverse Survivor Roster</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from over 30 unique survivors, each armed with distinct weapons and attack styles. Build the ultimate defense team to clash with the zombie horde.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00b7 Adjutant System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your team's gameplay with different adjutants. Change the tide of battle and overpower the undead with strategic adjutant combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00b7 Roguelike Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover over 200 unique roguelike items to assist in your survival. Adapt your strategy with every bullet and item to withstand the onslaught.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00b7 Epic Boss Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against formidable zombie bosses in thrilling TD clashes. Defend your tower and survive the toughest survival challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Join the battle against the zombie apocalypse! Command your survivors, clash with the undead, and become the ultimate defender in this relentless zombie survival game!</i></h2>",
    "short_description": "A thrilling tower defense survival game where you lead a team of survivors against relentless zombie hordes. Deploy unique fighters, strategize with adjutants, and adapt using roguelike upgrades. Defend your home, battle epic bosses, and survive the apocalypse!",
